@b = http://localhost:8141

### valid create -> 201
POST {{b}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Alice", "email": "alice@example.test", "age": 30, "password": "Str0ngPassword",
 "confirmPassword": "Str0ngPassword", "address": {"city": "Pune", "pin": "411001"}}

### every rule broken -> 400 problem with errors[]
POST {{b}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 5, "name": "", "email": "nope", "age": 12, "password": "weak", "confirmPassword": "other",
 "address": {"city": "", "pin": "12"}}

### same, French messages
POST {{b}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: fr

{"name": "A", "email": "a@example.test", "age": 30, "password": "weak", "confirmPassword": "weak",
 "address": {"city": "Pune", "pin": "12"}}

### update group (id required, password rules off)
PUT {{b}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 1, "name": "Alice B", "email": "alice@example.test", "age": 31, "address": {"city": "Pune", "pin": "411001"}}

